// Tactical points preset for m1l1.
// Mirrors koth_presets/<mapname>.scr: register points, return 1 on success.
//
// PLACEMENT IS PROVISIONAL. These two origins are borrowed from the m1l1 radio
// preset (known-valid in-world coordinates) purely so the pipeline can be tested
// end to end. They are NOT surveyed sniper/cover spots and the look directions
// are guesses.
//
// To author real points: stand on the spot in-game, run `coord` in the console,
// and use the printed position. Look direction is a VECTOR pointing where the
// bot should watch, not angles.
//
// Verify with `g_bot_debug_tactical_spots 1`, which prints each registered point
// with its score and forward reach. A point that warns about failing geometry
// evaluation is still registered, but the coordinate should be checked.

